        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu achigomba na Balaki achimuamba, “Nidzengera mwatu sabaa mwa kulavira sadaka, na unitayarishire ndzau sabaa na maturume sabaa hipha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki wahenda dza arivyoambirwa ni Balaamu, na Balaki na Balaamu achilavya ndzau mwenga na turume mwenga dzulu ya chila phatu pha kulavira sadaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Balaamu achimuamba Balaki, “Kala phapha phephi na sadakayo ya kuochwa. Mimi nauka chahi Mwenyezi Mlungu andakpwedza huonane. Chochosi ndichoniambira nindakuambira.” Phahi Balaamu achiphiya phatu pha dzulu phasiphomera chitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu achikutana naye. Balaamu achigomba na Mlungu achimuamba, “Nikatayarisha kare mo mwatu sabaa mwa kulavira sadaka, na nikalavya ndzau mwenga na turume mwenga dzulu ya chila phatu pha kulavira sadaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achimupha Balaamu ujumbe, achimuamba, “Uya kpwa Balaki, ukamuambire gara nchigokuambira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi wauya na achendamuona Balaki aimire kanda-kanda ya yo sadakaye ya kuochwa phamwenga na vilongozi osi a Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Balaamu achilavya nyo ujumbe achiamba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki achimuambira Balaamu, “Ukanihendadze we? Nákureha unilanire maadui gangu ela badalaye ukaabariki!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu achimjibu achimuamba, “Dze, che nigombe utu ambao Mwenyezi Mlungu kaniambirire niugombe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Balaki achimuamba Balaamu, “Ndzo huphiye phatu phanjina ambapho undaona achache tu, kundaweza kuaona nyo atu osi. Nawe undanilanira nyo atu kula phapho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Balaki achimuhala Balaamu achimphirika hadi weru wa Sofimu, dzulu ya mwango wa Pisiga. Hipho achidzenga mwatu sabaa mwa kulavira sadaka, na achilavya sadaka ya ndzau mwenga na turume mwenga dzulu ya chila phatu pha kulavira sadaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu achimuamba Balaki, “Ima phapha kanda-kanda ya sadakayo ya kuochwa, nami niphiye kura nkaonane na Mwenyezi Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achikutana na Balaamu, naye achimupha ujumbe achimuamba, “Uya kpwa Balaki ukamuambire gaga nchigokuambira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
