              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi achiuya na achendamuona Balaki aimire kanda-kanda ya yo sadakaye ya kuochwa phamwenga na vilongozi a Moabu. Balaki achimuuza achiamba, “Mwenyezi Mlungu akaambadze?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Balaamu achilavya ujumbe hinyu achiamba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Balaki achimuamba Balaamu, “Ichikala kundaalani, phahi piya usiabariki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Balaamu achimjibu Balaki achimuamba, “Dze siyakuambira kukala nindahenda chochosi Mwenyezi Mlungu ndichoniambira?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki achimuambira Balaamu, “Ndzo, nkuphirike phatu phanjina, chahi Mwenyezi Mlungu andakuruhusu unilanire nyo atu kula phapho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Balaki achimuhala Balaamu na achiphiya naye hadi dzulu ya mwango wa Peori, phatu ambapho uchikala dzuluze unaweza kuona ro jangbwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu achimuambira Balaki, “Nidzengera mwatu sabaa mwa kulavira sadaka, na unitayarishire ndzau sabaa na maturume sabaa hipha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Balaki achihenda dza arivyoambirwa ni Balaamu, na achilavya ndzau mwenga na turume mwenga dzulu ya chila phatu pha kulavira sadaka.",
          "type": "text",
